      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T01:49:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello,@schfan@google.com:\n  Excuse me, do you know under what circumstances the signature of the apk is empty? The annotation of the getSignatures method is Nullable.",
      "parentUuid": "80b6a339_994a8639",
      "revId": "7165b28a84c679a4190a3455632dc7280573fd70",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "faf460f7_d88b4d53",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 9,
      "author": {
        "id": 1351609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T02:05:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The annotation of the getSignatures method is Nullable.\n\nI think that has been answered, which is when you use `PackageManager.getPackageArchiveInfo()` to parse an APK on the file system, which may be unsigned and can\u0027t be installed, but can still be parsed and returned as a `PackageInfo`.",
      "parentUuid": "f884a634_82e6e693",
      "revId": "7165b28a84c679a4190a3455632dc7280573fd70",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
