        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 9,
      "author": {
        "id": 3183690
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T02:13:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@zhanghai@google.com \nOK, I understand, thanks for your advice.as @schfan@google.com said in bug/386702137,mSignatures is nullable and SigningDetails.getSignatures returns a @Nullable, so it\u0027s technically required to do null check at the caller side, though it\u0027s unclear how the package got into that state.I think we should make null judgment in this CL to avoid sysytem_server crash in some suition.Do you think?",
      "parentUuid": "faf460f7_d88b4d53",
      "revId": "7165b28a84c679a4190a3455632dc7280573fd70",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
