      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T18:00:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alright, I don\u0027t have a strong opinion against a null check, despite that I think it will hide an actual bug that will probably surface somewhere else in a different way, and if you are observing it on your platform you probably should fix your platform. I\u0027ll +1 and leave the +2 to Songchun.",
      "parentUuid": "33995c61_b6e308eb",
      "revId": "7165b28a84c679a4190a3455632dc7280573fd70",
